      summary: { zh: "把树画成 HTML 列表的优势是可访问性与文字排版，代价是自己处理展开/折叠状态。三个坑：click 要绑在可点击元素上、冒泡会让父节点抢走事件、动态生成的节点要靠事件委托才不会漏绑。", en: "Drawing the tree as an HTML list buys accessibility and text typography, at the cost of managing expand/collapse state yourself. The three pitfalls: bind click on the clickable element, bubbling lets parents steal events, and dynamically created nodes need event delegation so nothing is left unbound." },
