          answer: 1,
          explain: { zh: "逐个绑定时，每次展开折叠都会生成新 DOM，旧的监听器跟着元素被丢弃，需要反复重绑。把监听器绑在稳定的祖先容器上，靠 event.target 判断点中的是哪个节点，新节点天然就被覆盖。", en: "With per-element binding, every expand/collapse creates new DOM, old listeners are discarded with the elements, and you must re-bind repeatedly. Binding once on a stable ancestor and inspecting event.target covers new nodes for free." },
